# Aurora Synthesizer — environment template
#
# MVP requires NO secrets and NO environment variables.
# This file exists so future server-side integrations have a clear pattern.
#
# Rules:
# - Never put API keys in VITE_* variables (they ship to the browser).
# - Never commit .env.local or real secrets.
# - Proxy keyed APIs through a serverless function; keys live only in server env.

# Example (future, server-only — not used by the Vite client):
# NASA_API_KEY=
# NOAA_PROXY_URL=
